From f763964c7037454d2a89761afce6b5c6fa4856e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leonardo Tada Antunes <leonardotada@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 21:52:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 12/15] Repeat the dirty rounds until 512 pages are left, not
 2048

A remark that had to trace the subgraph behind 556 freshly written pages took
6 ms in a game frame. 128 pages was too slow to converge (more garbage piles
up: frag RSS +25%), 512 keeps both.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012fMmy9fJzqrWoKLQjC8Ssf
---
 source/d/gc/collector.d | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/source/d/gc/collector.d b/source/d/gc/collector.d
index 61ed480..ccb2f0f 100644
--- a/source/d/gc/collector.d
+++ b/source/d/gc/collector.d
@@ -438,7 +438,7 @@ private:
 		scope(exit) list.free();
 
 		enum MaxRounds = 8;
-		enum RemarkPages = 2048; // 8 MiB
+		enum RemarkPages = 512; // 2 MiB
 
 		uint rounds = 0;
 		size_t lastPages = 0;
-- 
